      "content": "I am currently drafting a paper on the microbial succession patterns in long-fermentation sourdough cultures. Could you provide a detailed breakdown of the metabolic transitions that occur as the environment shifts from a neutral pH to a more acidic state? I'm specifically looking for the biochemical mechanisms that facilitate this transition and how the dominance of certain species is established in such a micro-environment.",
